Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Chimera has multiple attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A head of fire, a body of\Nearth, and a tail of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it'll break\Nout of the ice pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I are about to undertake\Nour first Herculean labor of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll start with the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fire alone won't damage it much, so\NI'll give you some backup with my water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will that be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a combined attack will leave us\Nvulnerable to its water-based tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a plan for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plan has already been set in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we want to be together,\Nwe have to take this risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it will take me some time\Nto prepare for such an endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you all the time you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This plan requires me to trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're having second thoughts\Nbecause of Miss Claire. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.18,0:01:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.02,0:01:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to play some cat-imax,\Nyou big dumb kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where's Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.12,0:02:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right into our trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.18,0:02:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, you're up, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you act as if it\Nwere just another spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I've told you once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.22,0:02:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this technique is exponentially\Nmore powerful than my others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my aim falters in the slightest,\Nthen the spell will strike you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you can do this, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic! Rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to stay\Nby her side anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least I know that\NMiss Claire won't be alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.57,0:03:40.86,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.16,0:03:43.83,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.99,0:03:46.79,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.08,0:03:49.97,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.97,0:03:52.93,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.93,0:03:55.96,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.56,0:03:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we know about our pride.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.96,0:03:58.98,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or your All I want more of you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.98,0:04:01.30,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}All I want! Only you!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.30,0:04:05.19,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how immersive this game may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much in love with me We\Nhave hard to find the why
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.19,0:04:07.68,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Aren't you way too into it?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.68,0:04:09.31,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If I do it differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not an easy-style Happy End
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.31,0:04:11.15,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}there won't be a happy ending
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.15,0:04:13.56,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}What nonsense are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have a call.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.75,0:04:17.07,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}My wildest fantasies became my reality…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guss that will tranquility I will clear
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.07,0:04:19.57,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Ah, cool! You're cool! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.76,0:04:22.82,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Bringing such disruption to my once peaceful days…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your way to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avenue I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.16,0:04:25.58,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.79,0:04:27.45,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Love and hate both,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.45,0:04:33.69,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Without a partner, those feelings can never start!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let your heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.30,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So raise your hands!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.30,0:04:40.09,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to say no. Life.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.09,0:04:45.05,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let your heart be as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.05,0:04:46.93,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}from the bottom of your heart, hold up and
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.93,0:04:49.68,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Raise your hands! Surrender already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let your heart be as hard as you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.68,0:04:52.98,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! Throw 'em up and celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.76,0:04:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let your heart be as big as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rei-chan-han, more i-kai?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.98,0:04:55.77,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rei-chan-han, i-sekai?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.77,0:04:58.40,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.40,0:05:02.28,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I won't give up until you tell me what you're planning!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.28,0:05:05.12,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}You're so awesome! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Omoshiroi desu, I love you!
