Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, for a spoiled little\Nrich girl. Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Thane!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.28,0:05:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He barely grazed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it isn't the failure,\NPrince. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you the one behind all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My initial aim was to eliminate as\Nmany of the nobility as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this exceeds those aspirations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Savor your demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.08,0:06:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stayed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.03,0:06:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, his arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Hain, stay with us, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's infected with a new type of poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand back, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll neutralize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were able to save him? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Cantarella, a deadly\Npoison from the Nur Empire. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that where the\Nintruder was from as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, most likely.
