Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.87,0:07:19.91,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{=14}{\pos(605.79,913.03)\fscx99.23\fscy99.23\fnHiroshige\fs30\fsp0.5\bord1.5\c&H011D3F&\3c&H67A2B6&\blur0.8\fade(255,0,255,-2920,-2920,-760,40)}Sousse Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bower's sworn enemy, is usually behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They first use Cantarella\Nin the game's later stages,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's up to the heroine\Nto come up with the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, I knew how to counteract\Nit, but still... Rey! I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Fade?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.84,0:07:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut with a poison blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.30,0:07:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I neutralized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, it wouldn't hurt\Nto take him to a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.68,0:07:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just had to charge in by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they've arrested them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just like that, the whole\Nincident was brought to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The protests have ended, and it seems\Nthe commoner movement is fading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also know that Deed wasn't\Nresponsible for the assault,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.56,0:08:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Nur Empire was behind\Nit all from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we played right into\Nan enemy nation's hands like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will the entire Aurousseau\Nfamily be punished?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if they were manipulated,\Nthat doesn't change what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been relieved of duties\Npertaining to magic stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're presently awaiting\Nthe kingdom's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will happen to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What Master Lambert and Lene did\Namounts to treason against the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No escaping the death penalty for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot to tell you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that you both\Nwill be receiving a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A reward? Whatever for? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uncovering the mastermind\Nof an evil plot and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thwarting the plans of\Nour enemies for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then there was the part\Nwhere Rae saved Thane's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say you'll be\Nsummoned to the Royal Palace soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father would like to thank\Nthe both of you personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we let the culprit get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would... Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll gladly take what he has to offer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't we, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a breath and listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall give it our\Nvery best effort, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you just sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't relax with all that fidgeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm afraid I'm gonna\Nwrinkle my new outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lady, thank you for generously\Nbestowing these sweet thoughts upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not as if I did it for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be the one facing humiliation if\Nyou showed up looking like a vagrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can act coy all you want, but we\Nboth know it was a gesture of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you kindly be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it'd actually be rather\Nstriking if you kept your mouth shut. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire Francois, Miss\NRay Taylor, please follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His Majesty will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, lift your heads.
