43.27 94.64 941.72 96.42 940.82 96.42 938.15 93.75 936.82 92.64 935.48 92.72 879.55 95.51 878.26 98.08 878.48 100 877.41
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am also told that you\Nsaved my son's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For this, I owe you a great debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name your wish and it shall be granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thank you for your generous offer and\Nfor graciously granting us this audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is entirely up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I'd like to\Nhelp, I'm a commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't speak directly to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regarding our reward, there is but\None thing we would like to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what might that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A plea, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go, the moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beseech your majesty to spare\Nthe lives of the Aurousseaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my understanding that the Orasos\Nwere the primary culprits in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you truly suggesting that I\Nreduce the sentence for their crimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I humbly request that you show\Nmercy and grant them a pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salas, what say you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.24,0:12:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ours is a system of reward and punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see no justification for\Ncommuting their sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.86,0:12:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I implore you\Nto think of the Oroso's trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the past, they have\Ncontributed much to our economy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,particularly to the\Nbusiness of magic stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely such contributions support\Ntheir case for clemency, do they not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it truly infeasible to commute their\Nsentence in light of their services, Solace?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, we acknowledge the\Ncontributions you named.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But collusion with a foreign\Npower and plotting harm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,against the kingdom are\Ncrimes of the gravest nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing less than execution will suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so it shall be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please present a different request.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I'm not too late, I'd like to ask\Nthat you consider granting their appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may approach, Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This turmoil stemmed from unrest\Nand conflict between the classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The commoners rebelled against\Nwhat they saw as an injustice,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a wrong done to one of their\Nown in favor of a noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your majesty does not take\Nsteps to demonstrate equality,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we may face this again in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:13:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.01,0:14:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you believe that sparing the\NAurousseaus will help improve relations?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I may, your majesty, Prince Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is widespread suspicion\Nthat the Orusos were the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ones who founded the commoner\Nmovement in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they are spared, the nobles whose\Nchildren were endangered will not accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But people of all backgrounds\Ncontribute to our nation's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only nobles, but the common people who\Nmake up the majority of the population.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do not wish for your meritocracy\Nto be called an empty promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am prepared to make my final judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Aurousseau family will\Nbe exiled from this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, with all due...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have no dissent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The details of their banishment\Nshall be disclosed in due course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire Francois, Ray\NTaylor, you are dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stealing my words, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just share the same brain cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in your head and pretty soon I'm\Ngonna find my way into your heart too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I share no part of\Nyour demented brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's share our love instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just proved my point!\NWe did it! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really, really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.34,0:15:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the Oruso's\Npossessions were confiscated,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the entire family was\Nbanished to a neighboring land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you think all of them will find\Na way to survive out there in the Alps?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that Bartley, their\Nfamily's head, is remarkably competent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll secure sufficient means\Nto put food on the table, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about Lene and Lambert?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of them are being disowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, as long as they're\Nalive, they still have hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene! Ray! Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone wanted to come\Nand say goodbye to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to do nothing of the sort!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You practically dragged me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:16:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lie, I could see\Nthe longing in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just do your thing\Nand pretend I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.82,0:17:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I constantly try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to know some\Nthings haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could easily have executed us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.14,0:17:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,considering what we were accused\Nof, no one would have batted an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now we have a chance to start over,\Nbecause you two cared enough to intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thank you for stopping us, and for\Nspeaking to the king on our behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.16,0:17:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms. Claire... Time's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene, take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some more recipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as tasty as the mayonnaise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.60,0:18:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might help you earn a\Nfew coins out there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.12,0:18:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you both so much, truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can never repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Lene. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.84,0:18:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to bid you farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay in good health wherever\Nyour path takes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.50,0:19:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop prattling and become a horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the servant of Claire Francois.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.42,0:19:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which makes you the highest\Nranked commoner in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let anyone treat you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene, you'll never believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I met the most wonderful,\Nhandsome, charming prince. Lene!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.16,0:19:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.06,0:19:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was a good master to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.24,0:20:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.56,0:20:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.11,0:20:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clare will always be my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ms. Clare.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here if you need a hug, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a ridiculous suggestion. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will slap you, you impetuous creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid to cry. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not so frail the loss of\None servant would make me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.68,0:20:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.59,0:20:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see your face when\NI'm holding you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted her to stay, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.40,0:21:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world can be so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.26,0:21:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes we can't even stay\Nwith the people we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're incredibly audacious for\Na commoner, you realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup, guess this means you're\Ngoing to punish me for it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would only consider\Nit a reward anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.30,0:21:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got me all figured out,\Nyou scrunchies, naked chuse of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's enough now is\Nfor us to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.64,0:21:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.02,0:21:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be a fun wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.76,0:22:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain we will, someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
