Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.71,0:23:39.71,ed_eng_09_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}As we grow close to each other,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.71,0:23:44.92,ed_eng_09_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}My feelings keep growing stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.60,0:23:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.22,0:23:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and it was decided quite suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.94,0:23:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire's been pretty down as of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.92,0:23:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this will help\Ncheer her up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.86,0:23:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.77,0:23:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.69,0:23:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.60,0:24:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was Claire's first love.
